        "cooked": "<p>Greater Than Games, LLC is proud to announce its first expansion for the game Sentinels of the Multiverse!  Please give a warm welcome to <span class=\"bbcode-b\">[i]Sentinels of the Multiverse: Rook City</span> by checking out our Kickstarter here: <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1787899968/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-rook-city-expansion\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1787899968/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-rook-city-expansion</a></p>\n<p>We will have an official video about it in a few days, so stay tuned for that, too!  Additionally, throughout the course of the Kickstarter, we will be revealing more and more information about Rook City, so hold on to your hats!</p>",
